    "Command buffer is re-recorded per step (reset + begin/dispatch/end); dispatch geometry is fixed per circuit so pre-recording is possible in principle, but re-record cost is inside the measured submit path and no material gain was demonstrated \u2014 retained as-is (no unmeasured optimization)."
